>**Raises nation's Prosperity, Resources and Supplies at the cost of Supplies.**
=2 Walkthrough
+ You must participate in a Campaign battle and gain 2000xp __(verification needed)__.
+ After the battle, have your performance assessed by the {p:Campaign Arbiter|Campaign Arbiters} at the fortification in the area.
+ Report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* As the type of operation is Defensive, you must participate in defensive battles, i.e., battles in zones controlled by your allied allegiance.
* You still get the EXP/Limit Points and Allied Notes from Campaign as well as the reward from the Campaign Op.
* It appears that it is possible to accumulate the required points over several Campaign battles.
* A notice saying you have completed the mission will appear in the message window with Experience and {p:Allied Notes} upon satisfactory completion of the objectives.

=2 Objective
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
